%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: A14_9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: A group of people are in the middle of the street. The road under their
      feet is cracked, as if they landed there with massive force.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They are wearing black cloaks with hoods.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They look like some kind of cult.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It\u2019s the Interdimensional Spirits, just as you suspected."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Now that I take a closer look at them, I think I can recognise John in
      between them.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The pedestrians are frightened and distance themselves from the suspicious
      lot.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: In the front center of the group there is an especially tall figure.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: His stature is haughty but still intimidating.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Reminds me of Slender Man.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "That\u2019s when I notice him holding something with his long arms."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph, look! Those orbs, they look important.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The slender figure is holding four different coloured orbs.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Green, purple, blue\u2026 and a red one."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "This is\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph seems to have come to a realisation.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What is it?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "This is bad. I think those orbs are the cores of the universes. The blue
      one is exactly the same colour as Ethan\u2019s aura, and the red one is definitely
      the same as Ms. Moon\u2019s."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "What?? Is that why they can\u2019t be found anywhere right now? They\u2019ve
      been captured by those spirits?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: In that moment, the tall figure casts his gaze in our direction.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Oh, no! They\u2019re after Aleph!"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The final core and the Sustainer of Dimensional Principles. Seize them!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 52af34180e7f71641aafe2ffb133637b, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The group starts coming for us, each wielding the same black magic as John.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Aleph is the final orb?? I can\u2019t let them get to him!"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: '*ZING*'
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "My head\u2019s suddenly filled with ringing and then a familiar voice
      speaks to me, as if telepathically."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Child, the time has come. The evil Spirits seek to destroy every universe
      and unify the remains to rule over one single dimension on their own.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 937c3266c032ed848b44570d5bcf9116, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It\u2019s her! The one I saw in my dreams for a while, when I still didn\u2019t
      know anything about the state of the dimensions."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You must put a halt to their plans. Protect the last core with all your
      strength. With this, the last of my presence will vanish. Farewell, Child.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 937c3266c032ed848b44570d5bcf9116, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Thank you, former Sustainer. I will try anything to protect Aleph and fulfill
      my duties as the new Sustainer of Dimensional Principles!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph! Get behind me!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I feel a new power surge through my body.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I\u2019m not sure if it\u2019s because I just got a message from the former
      Sustainer or of it\u2019s just the adrenaline."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I can still save Aleph and the other cores. I can feel it!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Something that resembles the black magic power flows out of my hand, the
      only difference is that it was a pure, shimmering pink colour.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I feel the powers within me overflow from my hands and suddenly my vision
      changes.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2ac81b3fa8c07cf4883385768872e799, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fd27ea441d348b64e97e430be034160b, type: 2}
